lue": "Source title: Uma Educa\u00e7\u00e3o (Portuguese Edition)"}, "number_of_pages": 376, "physical_format": "paperback", "publish_date": "Sep 28, 2018", "publishers": ["Bertrand Editora"], "source_records": ["amazon:9722533797"], "title": "Uma Educa\u00e7\u00e3o", "covers": [14844154], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL18139176W"}], "key": "/books/OL57727922M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-02-15T22:17:03.889932"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-09-26T20:46:42.955684"}}}, "OLID:OL53223020M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL53223020M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL53223020M/Una_educaci\u00f3n", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL53223020M/Una_educaci\u00f3n", "thumbnail_url": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14657001-S.jpg", "details": {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL18139176W"}], "title": "Una educaci\u00f3n", "publishers": ["Lumen"], "publish_date": "2018", "key": "/books/OL53223020M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {"dep\u00f3sito_legal": ["B 10842-2018"]}, "covers": [14657001], "classifications": {"udc": ["821.111(73)-312.6\"20\""]}, "publish_places": ["Barcelona, Espan\u0303a"], "edition_name": "1a ed.", "contributors": [{"role": "Translator", "name": "Antonia Mart\u00edn"}], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/spa"}], "translation_of": "Educated", "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "physical_format": "Paperback", "number_of_pages": 464, "pagination": "464 p ; 23 cm", "isbn_13": ["9788426405166"], "oclc_numbers": ["1084516231"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "\u00abPod\u00e9is llamarlo transformaci\u00f3n. Metamorfosis. Falsedad. Traici\u00f3n. Yo lo llamo una educaci\u00f3n\u00bb. Nacida en las monta\u00f1as de Idaho, Tara Westover ha crecido en armon\u00eda con una naturaleza grandiosa y doblegada a las leyes que establece su padre, un morm\u00f3n fundamentalista convencido de que el final del mundo es inminente. Ni Tara ni sus hermanos van a la escuela o acuden al m\u00e9dico cuando enferman. Todos trabajan con el padre, y su madre es curandera y \u00fanica partera de la zona. Tara tiene un talento: el canto, y una obsesi\u00f3n: saber. Pone por primera vez los pies en un aula a los diecisiete a\u00f1os: no sabe que ha habido dos guerras mundiales, pero tampoco la fecha exacta de su nacimiento (no tiene documentos). Pronto descubre que la educaci\u00f3n es la \u00fanica v\u00eda para huir de su hogar. A pesar de empezar de cero, re\u00fane las fuerzas necesarias para preparar el examen de ingreso a la universidad, cruzar el oc\u00e9ano y graduarse en Cambridge, aunque para ello deba romper los lazos con su familia."}, "latest_revision": 4, "revision": 4, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-08-16T16:49:13.498861"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-09-04T22:16:49.347220"}}}, "OLID:OL47456756M": {"bib_key": "OLID:OL47456756M", "info_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL47456756M/Una_educaci\u00f3n", "preview": "noview", "preview_url": "http://openlibrary.org/books/OL47456756M/Una_educaci\u00f3n", "thumbnail_url": "https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/14061123-S.jpg", "details": {"type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "title": "Una educaci\u00f3n", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL7421324A", "name": "Tara Westover"}, {"key": "/authors/OL9274028A", "name": "Antonia Mart\u00edn Mart\u00edn"}], "publish_date": "Oct 08, 2020", "source_records": ["amazon:8466347844"], "number_of_pages": 472, "publishers": ["Debolsillo", "DEBOLSILLO"], "isbn_10": ["8466347844"], "isbn_13": ["9788466347846"], "physical_format": "mass market paperback", "full_title": "Una educaci\u00f3n", "covers": [14061123], "works": [{"key": "/works/OL18139176W"}], "key": "/books/OL47456756M", "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2023-04-16T16:54:39.195474"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2